  "legalTermsTitle": "Terms of Use",
  "legalPrivacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "legalEnactedOn": "Revised: October 11, 2026 (effective October 9, 2026)",
  "legalDemoNotice": "This text is a demo for a graduation project. It will be reviewed by a professional before real operation.",
  "legalContactTitle": "Contact",
  "termsArticle1Title": "Article 1 (Scope)",
  "termsArticle1Body": "These terms set out the conditions for using the EcoMeal smartphone app (the \"Service\"). By registering, you agree to these terms before using the Service.",
  "termsArticle2Title": "Article 2 (Your account)",
  "termsArticle2Body": "You register with an email address and password, LINE, or Apple. Keep your details accurate and do not share your password. If you register with LINE or Apple, these terms apply to your EcoMeal account in the same way. If we find misuse, we may suspend the account.",
  "termsArticle3Title": "Article 3 (Products)",
  "termsArticle3Body": "The food sold on the Service is surplus food cooked that day at partner restaurants (mystery bags). Contents and quantities vary by day, and prices drop as the sales deadline approaches. Check the allergens (28 items) and ingredient origins in the app before buying. Because the food is prepared in shared kitchens, trace cross-contact cannot be ruled out.",
  "termsArticle4Title": "Article 4 (Reservations and payment)",
  "termsArticle4Body": "You can make up to two reservations per day. Payment uses a card you have registered. The Service is in testing, so no real charges are made. Card numbers and security codes are not stored on our servers.",
  "termsArticle5Title": "Article 5 (Cancellations and refunds)",
  "termsArticle5Body": "Cancellations up to 30 minutes before the pickup time are fully refunded; later cancellations are not refunded. Reservations that cannot be filled because of a shortage are refunded automatically. Reservations not picked up before the truck leaves the pickup point expire without a refund.",
  "termsArticle6Title": "Article 6 (Pickup)",
  "termsArticle6Body": "Pick up your order from the Eco-Truck parked at the reserved pickup point and time by showing the QR code or confirmation code on the reservation screen.",
  "termsArticle7Title": "Article 7 (Location and notifications)",
  "termsArticle7Body": "Your location is used on your device to show nearby pickup points and is not stored on our servers. Notices (truck arriving, refunds, answers to your problem reports, new food bags at favourite pickup points) come to the app if app notifications are on. If they are off and you have linked LINE, they come from the EcoMeal official account on LINE. Truck-arrival notices go to LINE if you have linked LINE.",
  "termsArticle8Title": "Article 8 (Profile photo)",
  "termsArticle8Body": "Your profile photo is shown only on your own My Page. You may not upload images that infringe the rights of others, such as their likeness or copyrighted works, or images that are offensive. We may remove inappropriate images.",
  "termsArticle9Title": "Article 9 (Prohibited conduct)",
  "termsArticle9Body": "You may not break the law, harass other users, partner restaurants or drivers, resell purchased items, or attempt unauthorized access to the Service.",
  "termsArticle10Title": "Article 10 (Changes, suspension and disclaimer)",
  "termsArticle10Body": "The Service is being developed and tested as a graduation project and may be changed or suspended without notice. We will announce changes to these terms in the app and ask for your consent again for significant changes.",
  "privacySection1Title": "1. Information we collect",
  "privacySection1Body": "Registration details (email address, display name, furigana, profile photo), reservation and purchase history, payment methods (card brand, last four digits and expiry only), your LINE user ID if you sign in with or link LINE, the ID and email address Apple provides if you sign in with Apple (including Apple's private relay address), the content of your inquiries, how you use the app (records of opening food bags and the reservation screen), error information (error details, device type, app version), and a device identifier for sending notifications. We do not collect or store card numbers or security codes; our payment provider receives them directly.",
  "privacySection2Title": "2. Location",
  "privacySection2Body": "We use your device's location to show nearby pickup points, but it is not sent to or stored on our servers.",
  "privacySection3Title": "3. How we use it",
  "privacySection3Body": "To process reservations, handovers and refunds, send pickup notices, answer inquiries, and improve the Service.",
  "privacySection4Title": "4. Sharing and outsourcing",
  "privacySection4Body": "We do not share your information with third parties without your consent except where required by law. We use Supabase (data storage), Google Maps (maps), LINE and Firebase Cloud Messaging (notifications), Stripe (payments) and Sentry (error monitoring) to process data on our behalf.",
  "privacySection5Title": "5. Access, correction and deletion",
  "privacySection5Body": "To request access to or correction or deletion of your information, contact us through the inquiry form. You can delete your account and profile photo from My Page at any time.",
